# Alertmanager delivers Prometheus alerts to the owner's ops Telegram chat — a
# channel that is already open on a phone, because an alert in a channel nobody
# watches is the failure this service exists to fix.
#
#   ALERT_BOT_TOKEN  Telegram bot token (from @BotFather). The bot must be a
#                    member of the chat: another bot's token authenticates fine
#                    and then fails to post, which looks identical to no alerts.
#   ALERT_CHAT_ID    Numeric chat id (negative for groups).
#
# Both are substituted into the config at container start-up; Alertmanager does
# no environment expansion of its own.
ALERT_BOT_TOKEN=
ALERT_CHAT_ID=
